Decline a change or question; nothing runs

Usage: mxr assistant reject [OPTIONS] <CONVERSATION> <CALL_ID>

Arguments:
  <CONVERSATION>
  <CALL_ID>

Options:
      --reason <REASON>  Tell the assistant why, or what to do instead
      --no-wait
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
